{
  "bookId": "hero-213109",
  "id": "bond-37905",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "37905001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "听好了，新人。这次的作战是帮助小奏顺利完成「替人送包裹」的任务。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37905002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "要确保她的行进路线不受到任何干扰，但别被发现了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "37905004",
              "text": "知道了。"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "37905004",
              "text": "其实她能照顾好自己的。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "37905003",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37905004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "小奏已经出门了，作战开始！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37905005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "收到。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37905006",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "一段时间后……",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37905007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "有刚放学的小学生出现在小奏的10点钟方向。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37905008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "了解，我去引开他们。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37905009",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "有可疑的玩具车在横冲直撞啊！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37905010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "我去把它挪开。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37905011",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "野猫，喜欢叼手办的野猫出现了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37905012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "糟糕，它速度太快了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37905013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "那只猫已经到小奏面前了……可恶，用狙击吓走它吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "37905015",
              "text": "倒也不必用枪？"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "37905015",
              "text": "动静太大了吧？"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "37905014",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37905015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "等下，野猫趴倒了……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37905016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "居然同意让小奏骑上去了？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37905017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "看起来剩下的路有猫帮忙了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37905018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "哎，运气很好呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37905019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "所以说，她能照顾好自己的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
